  "description": "EHITAU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H44 Dy4 F4 N16 O18 4+,4(C1 H4 O1),4(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.514-4.210 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.58-129.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-O2)2(bshFtz)2(MeOH)2(H2O)8][NO3]4·4MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
